    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "school_main_chara_headteacher_01",
      "hash64": "F190C0E6B5D96E32",
      "text": "要是你在学校里遇到了困难，\\n请随时来和我商量吧。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "school_main_chara_headteacher_02",
      "hash64": "F190BFE6B5D96C7F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同学，\\n很高兴你能来我们学校。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "school_main_chara_battleteacher_01",
      "hash64": "FCF05F98B306ACEA",
      "text": "嘿呀！转学生！\\n要练肌肉！好处多多！[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "school_main_chara_battleteacher_02",
      "hash64": "FCF05E98B306AB37",
      "text": "嘿呀！转学生！\\n你平时会补充蛋白质吗！？[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "school_main_chara_mathteacher_01",
      "hash64": "1F03A89EE640703E",
      "text": "你好啊，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。\\n欢迎你随时问问题。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "school_main_chara_mathteacher_02",
      "hash64": "1F03A79EE6406E8B",
      "text": "哎呀，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。\\n你今天看起来也很精神，真是太好了。[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_01",
      "hash64": "E27F498E75633814",
      "text": "竟然和我搭话浪费时间，\\n你还真是个好事的学生啊。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_02",
      "hash64": "E27F4C8E75633D2D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]……\\n你可真是个耐人寻味的学生。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_03",
      "hash64": "E27F4B8E75633B7A",
      "text": "童话故事还在调查当中。\\n等着后续消息吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_04",
      "hash64": "E27F468E756332FB",
      "text": "寻找灾祸之宝的事……\\n等你有兴趣了，帮我调查一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "school_main_chara_historyteacher_05",
      "hash64": "E27F458E75633148",
      "text": "那些灾祸之宝如何？\\c\\n如果你不知道如何处置为好，\\n我随时都能替你接手。[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_01",
      "hash64": "AD66439216327F3E",
      "text": "如果你累了的话，\\n在医务室睡一会儿如何？[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "school_main_chara_healthteacher_02",
      "hash64": "AD66429216327D8B",
      "text": "这不是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]吗？\\n别勉强自己，休息一下吧～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_01",
      "hash64": "1E92750EDE0E0DFB",
      "text": "不要在意吾辈，\\n好好放松吧。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "school_main_chara_hometeacher_02",
      "hash64": "1E92760EDE0E0FAE",
      "text": "如果有推荐的甜品店的话，\\n希望你能分享给吾辈。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0608EFBD7D0DCC30",
      "text": "你好呀～你好。\\n你在收集宝可梦吗～？[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_02",
      "hash64": "0608F2BD7D0DD149",
      "text": "添加宝可梦图鉴！\\n目标是３０种～！\\r\\n完成后告诉我一声吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_03",
      "hash64": "0608F1BD7D0DCF96",
      "text": "添加宝可梦图鉴！\\n目标是１００种～！\\r\\n完成后告诉我一声吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
