      "label": "school_main_chara_pokelogicalteacher_06",
      "hash64": "0608F6BD7D0DD815",
      "text": "从此往后你也要和\\n很～多帕底亚的宝可梦相遇哦～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
