      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "school_main_chara_artteacher_02",
      "hash64": "EC8064D7456EB044",
      "text": "虽然挑战道馆也很重要，\\n但是你可不能忽视学业啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
